{"id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["92-df-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","depends_on":["[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-provability-predicate-—-Provability-Predicate-$\\mathrm{Prov}_G$\">df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (Gödel number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> (external proof-code relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (variables and capture-avoiding substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (a fixed internal arithmetic formula chosen to represent the external proof relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (free variables and external standard truth)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G,\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G,\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (definition targets for representation correctness, external provability, and the internal formula constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\bar k,v_1),\\bar m,v_0)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G:{}&amp;\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,t,v_0\\bigr)\n\\qquad(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\bar k,v_1),\\bar m,v_0)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G:{}&amp;\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,t,v_0\\bigr)\n\\qquad(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\)</span>是元语言中的数值关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)\\)</span>才是表示它的对象语言公式，二者不可直接混写</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(n)\\)</span>是外部谓词，表示编号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>有某个证明码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\\)</span>是对象语言公式构造器，只接收<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言数项；对固定句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>应写<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>最后一行使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>中固定的三元无捕获代入。若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>取标准有界证明检查公式，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span>为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>的存在依赖具体有效算术化与证明关系的可表示性；它不是从外部集合符号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>通过排版自动变成的公式</li>\n<li>这是构造Gödel句子的关键工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-provability-predicate-—-Provability-Predicate-$\\mathrm{Prov}_G$","text":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate $\\mathrm{Prov}_G$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"re